^{:go/breaks [[5 312]] :go/end 313} (go/method InliningIndex "InliningIndex returns the index into the global inlining\ntree recorded with the base. If b == nil or the base has\nnot been inlined, the result is < 0.\n" ^int [^{:tag (* PosBase)} b]
